                        "review": "to the moon is the kind of games that makes you both feel good and cry the hell out of your self.\nits like a spark to tell you to think about your life and how are you going to spend your time. it sparks you that you don't have much time to reach your goals and your dreams or wishes.\nI think who ever plays this game wont regret the time that have been spent. \nthe story is great 10/10\nstorytelling is also fantastic 9.5/10\nbut the gameplay mite hurt you because it does not have anything to present and there will be no new feature in gameplay and it could bore you but the story  and the curiosity of finding out that what's happening will let you stay tuned . \nI give this game a solid 8.8/10 and that's because of the gameplay .\nthanks for reading ❤❤",
